[38;2;124;124;124mMoreover, S has a prime factor not equal to p (since S > 1 and gcd(S, p) = 1), [0m
[38;2;124;124;124mso d = pS has a prime factor not dividing n = p^a. ✓[0m

[38;2;124;124;124m**Case 2: n = pq (two distinct primes, p < q)**[0m

