24m4[0m[4B[2A[2C[?25h[?2026l[?2026h[21A[19B[38;2;215;175;95m⣄[0m[4B[2A[2C[?25h[?2026l[?2026h[21A[19B[38;2;175;215;135m⡆⠀[0m[4B[2A[2C[?25h[?2026l[?2026h[21A[19B[38;2;175;215;135m⠇[0m[4B[2A[2C[?25h[?2026l[?2026h[21A[19B[38;2;175;215;135m⠋[0m[4B[2A[2C[?25h[?2026l[?2026h[21A[19B[38;2;135;215;175m⠉⠁[0m[4B[2A[2C[?25h[?2026l[?2026h[21A[J[38;2;124;124;124mSo d/n can be an integer for some composite n (e.g., n=20, d=280, d/n=14). But d[0m[38;2;124;124;124m∤ n² still. For n=20, d=280=2³·5·7, n²=400=2⁴·5². 280 | 400? 400/280 = 1.43... [0m
